'''Jack Hammer''' (ジャック・ハンマー, ''Jakku・Hanmā'', '''Jack Hammer''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Jack Hammer
|image = E 728.png
|first appearance = [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Jack Hammer is a standard midranger with pretty high damage who has a secret technique up his sleeve: [[Omni Strike]], reaching up to 480 range and hitting most backliner units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], while standing at 350, less than his maximum reach, allowing him to push through defenses more easily. To make your suffering last longer, he comes packed with a strong [[Weaken]] that has a fairly long duration in case your rusher or tanker units managed to survive his hits.

==Strategy==
Use rusher units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], and Awakened Bahamut Cat to rush through his Weaken and chip him down before things can get more chaotic. Time your units carefully given his high effective range.

